"id":28425121199,"node_id":"MIE_lADOEFLz888AAAABJpC4388AAAAGnkTtrw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/28425121199","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"milestoned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-07-24T08:06:39Z","milestone":{"title":"v0.29.0"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"sha":"30f97ece78428e44f4325ff9232f40e8a2d896fb","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDMwZjk3ZWNlNzg0MjhlNDRmNDMyNWZmOTIzMmY0MGU4YTJkODk2ZmI","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/30f97ece78428e44f4325ff9232f40e8a2d896fb","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/30f97ece78428e44f4325ff9232f40e8a2d896fb","author":{"name":"Arpit Jain","email":"arpitjain099@gmail.com","date":"2026-07-21T18:34:29Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2026-07-28T07:41:47Z"},"tree":{"sha":"790b29141917aa6e88fbf46f86e08559ae891143","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/790b29141917aa6e88fbf46f86e08559ae891143"},"message":"auth: check machine key on the followup registration path\n\nwaitForFollowup returns nodeToRegisterResponse for a completed\nregistration without checking that the Noise session polling for the\nresult was started with the machine key that opened the registration.\nThat response carries the registering user's User and Login, so the auth\nID in the followup URL is the only thing protecting it.\n\nhandleRegister and handleLogout both call machineKeyMismatch before\nhanding back a node, so this is the one path of the three that does not.\nThe key is already available: HandleNodeFromAuthPath resolves the node\nfrom the MachineKey cached in RegistrationData, so on the normal path the\nnode and the session agree and the check is a no-op.\n\nThe auth ID is 96 bits of randomness and is not guessable, so this is not\nreachable by brute force. It is logged at info level when a registration\nis created, which makes log access the realistic way to obtain one.\n\nThe existing followup_registration_success case built its node with\nCreateNodeForTest, which picks a random machine key that no real\nregistration would produce. Set the registering machine key so the\nfixture matches the production path.\n\nSigned-off-by: Arpit Jain <arpitjain099@gmail.com>","parents":[{"sha":"7a1ee34f7122993ff1b6c703eef96545832c034a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/7a1ee34f7122993ff1b6c703eef96545832c034a","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/7a1ee34f7122993ff1b6c703eef96545832c034a"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgmMAoz5Zf+w0nAxyA6/zsNd95cP\n98YbtHIIXyy9A1sssAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQPQwo9jwfPQHXa8aR6exhaTuhMUr/XAI3Aux2srOneYRwfLRjDStFSYJZg15N5qZdt\nZN2UsD/Y0FBESxVolabgc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 790b29141917aa6e88fbf46f86e08559ae891143\nparent 7a1ee34f7122993ff1b6c703eef96545832c034a\nauthor Arpit Jain <arpitjain099@gmail.com> 1784658869 +0900\ncommitter Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1785224507 +0200\n\nauth: check machine key on the followup registration path\n\nwaitForFollowup returns nodeToRegisterResponse for a completed\nregistration without checking that the Noise session polling for the\nresult was started with the machine key that opened the registration.\nThat response carries the registering user's User and Login, so the auth\nID in the followup URL is the only thing protecting it.\n\nhandleRegister and handleLogout both call machineKeyMismatch before\nhanding back a node, so this is the one path of the three that does not.\nThe key is already available: HandleNodeFromAuthPath resolves the node\nfrom the MachineKey cached in RegistrationData, so on the normal path the\nnode and the session agree and the check is a no-op.\n\nThe auth ID is 96 bits of randomness and is not guessable, so this is not\nreachable by brute force. It is logged at info level when a registration\nis created, which makes log access the realistic way to obtain one.\n\nThe existing followup_registration_success case built its node with\nCreateNodeForTest, which picks a random machine key that no real\nregistration would produce. Set the registering machine key so the\nfixture matches the production path.\n\nSigned-off-by: Arpit Jain <arpitjain099@gmail.com>\n","verified_at":"2026-07-28T07:41:56Z"},"event":"committed"},{"id":28584050517,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz888AAAABJpC4388AAAAGp73_VQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/28584050517","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gist